1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,630
Your best friend

2
00:00:00,630 --> 00:00:01,840
vanishes mid-sentence.

3
00:00:02,230 --> 00:00:04,190
Her coffee splashes
the pavement.

4
00:00:04,190 --> 00:00:05,450
You're
still here.

5
00:00:05,450 --> 00:00:06,190
Every other
woman

6
00:00:06,190 --> 00:00:08,010
and girl
disappears once.

7
00:00:08,010 --> 00:00:09,070
Men remain.

8
00:00:09,070 --> 00:00:10,450
You're the
exception.

9
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:12,470
On the roads,
drivers vanish.

10
00:00:12,470 --> 00:00:13,270
In hospitals,

11
00:00:13,270 --> 00:00:14,110
missing
staff leave

12
00:00:14,110 --> 00:00:15,320
patients waiting.

13
00:00:16,450 --> 00:00:18,150
Your phone
lights up.

14
00:00:18,150 --> 00:00:20,070
Dad asks: are
you safe?

15
00:00:20,070 --> 00:00:21,200
Do you answer?

16
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:23,180
But here's
the twist:

17
00:00:23,450 --> 00:00:24,630
frozen
embryos still

18
00:00:24,630 --> 00:00:26,480
carry other
women's DNA.

19
00:00:27,950 --> 00:00:28,990
Those embryos
still

20
00:00:28,990 --> 00:00:30,310
need a
pregnancy.

21
00:00:30,310 --> 00:00:31,730
Preserved
genes alone

22
00:00:31,730 --> 00:00:33,740
cannot restart
a population.

23
00:00:34,450 --> 00:00:35,690
Artificial
wombs have

24
00:00:35,690 --> 00:00:37,690
supported
premature lambs.

25
00:00:37,690 --> 00:00:38,910
Full human
pregnancy

26
00:00:38,910 --> 00:00:40,950
is still
beyond them.

27
00:00:40,950 --> 00:00:42,370
If you choose
treatment

28
00:00:42,370 --> 00:00:44,920
and can carry
a pregnancy,

29
00:00:45,290 --> 00:00:47,420
a daughter
could be born.

30
00:00:47,950 --> 00:00:48,830
Would you
tell the

31
00:00:48,830 --> 00:00:50,520
world you
survived?

32
00:00:50,950 --> 00:00:54,500
Rewind to that fallen
cup of coffee.
